cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "pt-neural-memory: addressed RLS-cell associative memory and nonlinear regressor"
abstract: >-
  A fast associative memory built from addressed recursive-least-squares cells,
  with a closed-form nonlinear regression mode and a continual-learning
  benchmark showing no catastrophic forgetting when the table retains every
  stored pair.
authors:
  - family-names: Solorzano
    given-names: Jose
    email: jose.h.solorzano@gmail.com
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-29
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/jose-solorzano/pt-neural-memory"
keywords:
  - associative memory
  - continual learning
  - catastrophic forgetting
  - recursive least squares
  - random features
